"c":"遵","pinyin":"zūn","lectures":["zūn"],"niveau":5,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["辶","丷","酉","寸"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L5-1071","L7-5622","L7-5623"],"chemin":{},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"suivre, se conformer à","acceptions":[{"categorie":"V","fr":"suivre, se conformer à, observer"}]},"exemples":[{"zh":"请遵照医生的话按时吃药。","pinyin":"Qǐng zūnzhào yīshēng de huà ànshí chī yào.","fr":"Suivez les indications du médecin et prenez vos médicaments à l'heure.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":null},"昨":{"c":"昨","pinyin":"zuó","lectures":["zuó"],"niveau":1,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["日","乍"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L1-0495"],"chemin":{"hsk":143,"lire":129},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"hier, la veille, le passé","acceptions":[]},"exemples":[],"origine":{"statut":"relu","etiquette":"atteste","fr":"Le Shuowen jiezi range 昨 parmi les caractères idéo-phonétiques : 日, le jour, pour le sens, et 乍 pour le son. 乍 se lit aujourd'hui zhà, loin de zuó, mais on le retrouve dans 作 zuò et 怎 zěn. 昨 désigne la veille, et plus largement le passé.","en":"The Shuowen jiezi classes 昨 as a sound-meaning compound: 日, the day, for the meaning, and 乍 for the sound. 乍 is read zhà today, far from zuó, but it reappears in 作 zuò and 怎 zěn. 昨 names the day before, and more broadly the past.","roles":{"日":"sens","乍":"forme"}}},"琢":{"c":"琢","pinyin":"zuó","lectures":["zuó","zhuó"],"niveau":7,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["王","豖"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L7-5624"],"chemin":{},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"ciseler (le jade) ; réfléchir","acceptions":[{"categorie":"V","fr":"ciseler, polir (le jade)","pinyin":"zhuó"},{"categorie":"V","fr":"réfléchir, ruminer (dans zuómo)"}]},"exemples":[],"origine":null},"佐":{"c":"佐","pinyin":"zuǒ","lectures":["zuǒ"],"niveau":7,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["亻","𠂇","工"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L7-5626"],"chemin":{},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"assister, seconder","acceptions":[{"categorie":"V","fr":"assister, seconder"}]},"exemples":[],"origine":null},"左":{"c":"左","pinyin":"zuǒ","lectures":["zuǒ"],"niveau":1,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["𠂇","工"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L1-0496","L1-0497","L3-0970","L7-5625"],"chemin":{"hsk":12},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"gauche","acceptions":[{"categorie":"N","fr":"la gauche, côté gauche"}]},"exemples":[{"zh":"他用左手写字。","pinyin":"Tā yòng zuǒshǒu xiězì.","fr":"Il écrit de la main gauche.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":null},"作":{"c":"作","pinyin":"zuò","lectures":["zuò","zuō","zuó"],"niveau":1,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["亻","乍"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L1-0088","L1-0124","L2-0277","L2-0764","L2-0765","L2-0766","L2-0767","L3-0116","L3-0290","L3-0797","L3-0926","L3-0971","L3-0972","L4-0067","L4-0973","L4-0998","L4-0999","L5-0280","L6-0116","L6-0202","L6-0504","L6-1019","L6-1137","L6-1138","L6-1139","L7-0445","L7-1033","L7-1222","L7-1341","L7-1615","L7-3028","L7-3033","L7-3976","L7-4359","L7-4381","L7-4583","L7-4912","L7-4922","L7-5309","L7-5627","L7-5628","L7-5629","L7-5630","L7-5631"],"chemin":{"hsk":144,"lire":131},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"faire, créer, agir en tant que","acceptions":[]},"exemples":[{"zh":"他在医院工作。","pinyin":"Tā zài yīyuàn gōngzuò.","fr":"Il travaille à l'hôpital.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":{"statut":"relu","etiquette":"atteste","fr":"Sur les os oraculaires, 乍 à lui seul s'employait déjà pour « faire », « construire ». La clé de l'homme 亻 a été ajoutée ensuite pour marquer l'action humaine, et 乍 est resté pour le son. Il se lit aujourd'hui zhà, loin de zuò, mais on le retrouve dans 昨 zuó et 怎 zěn.","en":"On oracle bones, 乍 on its own was already used for “to make” or “to build”. The person component 亻 was added later to mark human action, and 乍 stayed on for the sound. It is read zhà today, far from zuò, but it reappears in 昨 zuó and 怎 zěn.","roles":{"亻":"sens","乍":"forme"}}},"做":{"c":"做","pinyin":"zuò","lectures":["zuò"],"niveau":1,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["亻","十","口","攵"],"sources":["surcharge"]},"mots":["L1-0500","L2-0770","L2-0771","L2-0772","L3-0973","L4-1000","L7-0900","L7-5635","L7-5636"],"chemin":{"hsk":146},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"faire, fabriquer ; servir de","acceptions":[{"categorie":"V","fr":"faire, fabriquer, préparer"},{"categorie":"V","fr":"exercer, servir de"}]},"exemples":[{"zh":"你在做什么？","pinyin":"Nǐ zài zuò shénme?","fr":"Qu'est-ce que tu fabriques ?","statut":"relu"},{"zh":"她做的菜很好吃。","pinyin":"Tā zuò de cài hěn hǎochī.","fr":"Elle cuisine très bien.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":null},"坐":{"c":"坐","pinyin":"zuò","lectures":["zuò"],"niveau":1,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["人","人","土"],"sources":["surcharge"]},"mots":["L1-0300","L1-0498","L1-0499","L5-0112","L7-5632"],"chemin":{"hsk":145,"lire":130},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"s'asseoir, prendre (un transport)","acceptions":[]},"exemples":[{"zh":"你坐这儿吧。","pinyin":"Nǐ zuò zhèr ba.","fr":"Mets-toi ici.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":{"statut":"relu","etiquette":"atteste","fr":"Le Shuowen jiezi donne pour 坐 une forme ancienne faite de deux personnes 人 sur la terre 土. On s'asseyait alors sur des nattes posées au sol, face à face. Dans la forme actuelle, les deux 人 se tiennent de part et d'autre du trait vertical de 土.","en":"The Shuowen jiezi gives an ancient form of 坐 made of two people 人 on the ground 土. In those days people sat on mats laid on the floor, facing each other. In today's form, the two 人 sit on either side of the vertical stroke of 土.","roles":{}}},"座":{"c":"座","pinyin":"zuò","lectures":["zuò"],"niveau":2,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["广","人","人","土"],"sources":["cjk-decomp","surcharge"]},"mots":["L2-0768","L2-0769","L4-0386","L6-0684","L6-1140","L7-2261","L7-4638","L7-5633","L7-5634"],"chemin":{},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"classif. des monts, bâtiments ; siège","acceptions":[{"categorie":"M","fr":"classificateur des montagnes, des ponts, des bâtiments"},{"categorie":"N","fr":"siège, place"}]},"exemples":[{"zh":"那座山很高。","pinyin":"Nà zuò shān hěn gāo.","fr":"Cette montagne-là est très haute.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":null}}}
